{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0092_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0047fa7004c20a3347ef409bcc474a5b36f4e2b1d6bd05e8b5987f5af126e038", "ja": "（今回のライブは動物との触れ合いがテーマだ。\nみんな、違う動物を担当する事になっているけど……）", "zh": "（这次的演唱会主题是与动物们的互动。\n大家各自负责不同的动物……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0092_1001_018ele", "source_sha256": "a7367ada26b8caa9501e170793f182fc4198bae780d233037a7c5be825b1f48a", "ja": "ワオ！　この動物園のコは、みんなイキがいいネ！\nそれに人懐っこくて、すごくかわいいヨ～♪", "zh": "哇喔！这间动物园的动物都很生猛耶！\n而且很亲近人，好可爱喔～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0092_1002_p", "source_sha256": "1b65f859b7a2721bb91bc695572f83f49f387819cb6b9cc61fcfecb54bb1c065", "ja": "イキがいいって、魚じゃないんだから……。\nエレナは確か、ジャガー担当だったな。", "zh": "什么生猛，又不是海鲜……\n艾琳娜，你负责的动物是美洲豹对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0092_1003_018ele", "source_sha256": "4aa59baec1aed642ea59e75a554e1ea620e0e7ddac9bc5a58f27bab8d7ba20bf", "ja": "ウン、そうだヨ！　ワタシ、ジャガーには\nちょっと詳しいんだから。エヘヘ♪", "zh": "嗯，对啊！\n我对美洲豹小有研究喔，嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0092_1004_p", "source_sha256": "f4f1ac48985b1fd7763de8fd0715d29f53f2135d6f447b086e4f5a3e9ee7a7a8", "ja": "そうか。でもライオンやトラもいるのに、\nどうしてジャガーなんだ？", "zh": "这样吗？不过园里也有狮子跟老虎，\n为什么你要挑美洲豹呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0092_1005_018ele", "source_sha256": "6b5cc344ee862df5df368b980b0fd03042ff634bfcbf759b3bfe12824840173b", "ja": "えっと……ジャガーは、ワタシが生まれた\nブラジルにいるから？", "zh": "这个嘛……\n因为我出生的巴西也有美洲豹的关系？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0092_1006_018ele", "source_sha256": "9be7f55c6ff2ba6a7f16134b83e3b4001b4218536bc4a2f7d00ee54f6f7ef7c1", "ja": "それに、クールでカッコイイでしょ？", "zh": "而且，美洲豹又酷又帅气，不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0092_1007_p", "source_sha256": "2c0f6f1c7962a6f737fc047fd8a9895018ba9a91f8b3f504095e16558ccdfe01", "ja": "そうか、ジャガーは中南米の動物だったか。\nカッコイイ……確かに、カッコイイのは大事だな。", "zh": "我都忘了，美洲豹是中南美洲的动物。\n帅气啊……的确，帅气是很重要的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0092_1008_018ele", "source_sha256": "99fb71058ea3fc12487c77e70990d8a0dda47e5393ba0ce4b35acc2e744f9d89", "ja": "エヘヘ、そうだヨっ！　だからワタシも、\nカッコいいステージにしなくちゃネ♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，对啊！\n所以我也得展现一场帅气的表演才行♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0092_1009_018ele", "source_sha256": "e60360d1fc7cd49b4e9053dbf74c6d2926aec1cdcd967f27ab90474460232dc7", "ja": "あとはセクシーで、ミステリアスだとカンペキかナ？\nねーねー、{$P$}はどう思う～？", "zh": "要是能再加上一点性感、神秘的感觉就更完美了吧？\n欸欸～{$P$}，你觉得呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
